> { lo djacu ku dunja lo jacke'o be li no .i xu na }
> { lo djacu ku dunja lo jacke'o be li no .i xu }

Both are grammatical, but after ".i xu na" I'm expecting a brivla, so it's 
probably intended as an answer to a question to which one could also 
answer "ja'a".

